<p>Hello <%= @resource.try(:first_name).presence || @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset the password for your Dr WISE account. Click the link below to set a new password:</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Set a new password', edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>This link expires in <%= (Devise.reset_password_within / 1.hour).to_i %> hours and can be used only once.</p>

<p>If you didn't request this, you can ignore this email - your password won't change.</p>
